      <title><![CDATA[Announcing the RSS Feed Plugin]]></title>
      <category>feed</category>
      <description><![CDATA[]]></description>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>I am excited to announce the release of a new plugin designed to allow your audience to follow your wiki. This new tool automatically generates a valid RSS 2.0 feed directly from your specified tiddlers and pushes the file from your wiki, straight to GitHub.</p>]]></content:encoded>
